<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SEHATI · Sistem Elektronik Healthcare Anda Terintegrasi</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/base.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/patient.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/sehati.css">
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <div class="hero">
    <span class="hero-mark">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21s-7-4.35-9.5-8.5C1 9 2.5 5 6.5 5 9 5 12 8 12 8s3-3 5.5-3C21.5 5 23 9 21.5 12.5 19 16.65 12 21 12 21z"></path></svg>
    </span>
    <h1>SEHATI</h1>
    <p>Sistem Elektronik Healthcare Anda Terintegrasi — portal rekam medis elektronik rawat jalan.</p>

    <div class="hero-cards">
      <a class="role-card" href="/auth/pasien/login">
        <span class="icon-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Pasien</h3>
        <p>Booking jadwal, tulis keluhan, & lihat riwayat medis Anda.</p>
        <span class="cta">Masuk via OTP &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a class="role-card" href="/auth/login">
        <span class="icon-wrap">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-12V5l-8-3-8 3v5c0 8 8 12 8 12z"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Tenaga Medis & Staf</h3>
        <p>Dokter, perawat, resepsionis, admin & super admin.</p>
        <span class="cta">Login username &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="admin-link">
      Sistem mengacu <b>Permenkes No. 24/2022</b> · dokumentasi klinis format SOAP · diagnosis ICD-10.
    </p>
  </div>
</main>
<footer class="app-footer">
  SEHATI · Institut Teknologi Bacharuddin Jusuf Habibie · Program Studi Rekayasa Perangkat Lunak.
</footer>
